{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because it's a 'fairytale' when a fairy tells it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate's Theater is a mischievous turn-based card storyteller where fairies Fortune and Misfortune duel to twist mortal lives into\u00a0short, rhyming couplets. Pair Mortals and nudge the balance to reveal over 400 hand-written, two-line tales \u2013 each branching toward a bright serendipity or a gleefully gruesome doom, depending on which fairy claims the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a nutshell, Fate's Theater is a compact narrative duel built around curiosity, dark comedy, resource mind games, and collecting strange little fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/2fdc974c48d029f3cc6e3d9126cd62fd.poster.avif?t=1772025835\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/2fdc974c48d029f3cc6e3d9126cd62fd.webm?t=1772025835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/2fdc974c48d029f3cc6e3d9126cd62fd.mp4?t=1772025835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u201cWhere mortal fates take wicked swings,</i>      <br><i>You choose which fairy pulls the strings!\u201d</i>  <br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Tiny Tales</strong> \u2014 Over 400 two-line rhyming couplets revealed through card combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin Fates</strong> \u2014 Each couplet splits between Fortune's favor and Misfortune's wicked turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Meets Macabre</strong> \u2014 Unsuspecting mortals meet new friends\u2026 or meet terrible ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Collection</strong> \u2014 Grow your catalog of revealed fates and expand your cast of Mortals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Strategy</strong> \u2014 Simple rules, hidden wagers, and subtle resource mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Theater</strong> \u2014 Adorable puppet silhouettes with reactive, atmospheric music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Friendly Duels</strong> \u2014 Face a theatrical bot or invite a friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honest Indie</strong> \u2014 A polished, compact experience at a coffee's price, made with care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/9c5f60abe03edeffc2815a8cba38ee87.poster.avif?t=1772025835\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/9c5f60abe03edeffc2815a8cba38ee87.webm?t=1772025835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/extras/9c5f60abe03edeffc2815a8cba38ee87.mp4?t=1772025835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u201cFortune's kiss, Misfortune's curse,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Who gets to write the final verse?\u201d</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fortune Favors Fools","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Straight to the Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"No Strings Attached","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Poker Face Fairy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Shattering Scales","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"All for Nothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Stalemate Sonata","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Fate Already Decided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"A Delicate Balance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"},{"name":"Typecast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2804100/1da563b416d25b8b3f7622ed83532b846ac8bc70.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804100?t=1772025835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804100?t=1772025835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/78fe0d3eb600458823c135c390fc18b61cdd07e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772025835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/78fe0d3eb600458823c135c390fc18b61cdd07e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772025835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}